# Title: .RDP File Created By Uncommon Application
# ID: fccfb43e-09a7-4bd2-8b37-a5a7df33386d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-04-18
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects creation of a file with an ".rdp" extension by an application that doesn't commonly create such files.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(TargetFilename:*.rdp AND (Image:*\\brave.exe OR Image:*\\CCleaner Browser\\Application\\CCleanerBrowser.exe OR Image:*\\chromium.exe OR Image:*\\firefox.exe OR Image:*\\Google\\Chrome\\Application\\chrome.exe OR Image:*\\iexplore.exe OR Image:*\\microsoftedge.exe OR Image:*\\msedge.exe OR Image:*\\Opera.exe OR Image:*\\Vivaldi.exe OR Image:*\\Whale.exe OR Image:*\\olk.exe OR Image:*\\Outlook.exe OR Image:*\\RuntimeBroker.exe OR Image:*\\Thunderbird.exe OR Image:*\\Discord.exe OR Image:*\\Keybase.exe OR Image:*\\msteams.exe OR Image:*\\Slack.exe OR Image:*\\teams.exe))
